              "symbol": "Command.execute",
              "span": {
                "from": 67,
                "to": 100
              },
              "role": "usage"
            }
          ],
          "note": "### Pre-run hooks can prepare or stop work\n\nCobra checks persistent hooks across the parent chain, then the selected command’s hook. By default, the first persistent hook found runs; error-returning hooks can stop execution.",
          "editor": {
            "primary": "command.go"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "t7",
          "view": "view:execution",
          "focus": [
