                "to": 139
              },
              "role": "usage"
            }
          ],
          "note": "### Post-run hooks follow a successful handler\n\nA handler error returns before these hooks. If a post-run hook reports an error, execution returns that error instead of success.",
          "editor": {
            "primary": "command.go"
          }
        }
